<view class="page">
  <view class="banner onboard-banner">
    <view class="title">欢迎使用病例夹</view>
    <view class="sub white">微信登录后创建第一份健康档案</view>
  </view>
  <view class="pad mt-16">
    <view class="intro-card">
      <view class="body strong">创建第一份档案</view>
      <view class="sub mt-8">已有档案可直接微信登录继续使用。首次使用时，请先选择这份档案是为自己还是为亲属创建。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="choice card card-pad mt-12 {{selfSelectedClass}}" data-relation="我自己" bindtap="selectRelation">
      <view class="choice-icon">我</view>
      <view class="flex"><view class="body strong">为我自己</view><view class="tiny">管理自己的健康数据</view></view>
      <view class="arrow">›</view>
    </view>
    <view class="choice card card-pad mt-12 {{familySelectedClass}}" data-relation="妈妈" bindtap="selectRelation">
      <view class="choice-icon warm">亲</view>
      <view class="flex"><view class="body strong">为我的亲属</view><view class="tiny">帮父母 / 长辈管理报告与复查</view></view>
      <view class="arrow">›</view>
    </view>
    <view class="onboard-footer">
      <view class="agreement-row" bindtap="toggleAgree">
        <view class="checkbox {{agreed ? 'checked' : ''}}">{{agreed ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
        <view class="agreement-copy">
          <text>我已阅读并同意</text>
          <text class="agreement-link" catchtap="openAgreement">用户协议</text>
          <text>和</text>
          <text class="agreement-link" catchtap="openPrivacy">隐私政策</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="tiny mt-8">微信登录仅用于创建和同步档案；本应用用于健康数据管理，不提供诊断或治疗建议。</view>
      <view class="btn mt-12 {{continueDisabledClass}}" bindtap="continueCreate">{{loggingIn ? '登录中...' : '微信登录并继续'}}</view>
      <view class="tiny center mt-12">所有档案的数据归患者本人所有，本应用严格保护隐私</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
